CORE
main.c
--show-local-bitvector-analysis
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^  main::1::local: \+dynamic_local$
^  main::1::global: \+static_lifetime$
^  main::1::null: \+null$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Each pointer is classified by what it may point to: a local variable, an object
with static lifetime, or nothing.
